cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "NA2smol: pocket-conditioned 3D molecular generation for nucleic-acid targets"
abstract: >-
  Code and data layout for reproducing NA2smol, a Bayesian Flow Network that generates
  small molecules inside nucleic-acid binding pockets using shared physicochemical pocket
  descriptors, ligand-only electron-density pretraining and a teacher-student alignment loss.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yuhan-Fei/rna2smol"
keywords:
  - molecular generation
  - nucleic acid
  - Bayesian Flow Network
  - electron density
  - drug design
authors:
  - name: "NA2smol authors"
